 "insight": [
  "The main product chapters exported by Luxembourg to Japan and China in 2025 were wadding, felt and nonwovens, machinery and mechanical appliances, and copper and articles thereof.",
  "Total exports reached 288.9 million euros in 2025, with the top three product chapters accounting for 67.1% of exports.",
  "Wadding, felt and nonwovens was the largest export category at 94.4 million euros, representing 32.7% of total exports.",
  "Machinery and mechanical appliances followed with 52.4 million euros, and copper and articles thereof with 47.0 million euros.",
  "The values are nominal and not adjusted for price changes, which limits direct comparison over time."
 ],
